flowchart LR
    Request[Caller-controlled stable-core request]
    Caller[Authorized caller]
    Kernel[Control-plane kernel]
    Ledger[(Metadata-only ledger and Evidence)]
    Input[(Owner-private bounded transient input)]
    Worker[Per-request supervisor]
    Fixed[Fixed executable, argv, env, deadline]
    Broker[Stable-core broker]
    Result[(Owner-private bounded transient result)]

    Request --> Caller
    subgraph PrivateBoundary[Owner-private control-plane boundary]
        Kernel --> Ledger
        Input -->|consume once| Worker
        Worker -->|policy-bound call| Kernel
        Worker --> Fixed
        Fixed -->|metadata receipt| Kernel
        Kernel --> Ledger
        Fixed -->|consume-once envelope| Result
    end
    Caller -->|reserve exact identity and digest| Kernel
    Caller -->|stage raw input; never durable| Input
    Fixed --> Broker
    Broker -->|raw stdout/stderr in memory only| Fixed
    Result --> Caller
    Caller -. retry may return result_available=false .-> Kernel
